pySMESH: OCCT 8.0 removed BOPDS_ListOfPaveBlock; name the NCollection list of pave blocks that it stood for.

GEOMAlgo_WireSolid.cxx includes BOPDS_ListOfPaveBlock.hxx and binds the result of
BOPDS_DS::PaveBlocks to a BOPDS_ListOfPaveBlock reference. OCCT 8.0.1 has neither the header
nor the typedef: BOPDS_DS::PaveBlocks returns NCollection_List<occ::handle<BOPDS_PaveBlock>>,
the type that the typedef named. The include goes (the file includes BOPDS_PaveBlock.hxx
already) and the reference names the list type. No compiled code changes.

